{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H6zsgX8IFX1795685286.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國太空站迎來首位外籍航天員，巴基斯坦載荷專家穆罕默德．齊尚．阿里，搭乘神舟二十四號飛船順利進駐。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_QQ.PAK.ASTRONAUT-1800.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PNspSJGN5m1795689048.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>1986年出生的齊尚．阿里，從小就有一個航天夢。他兒時的日記簿貼滿航天相關的剪報，其中更有中國首位航天員楊利偉的剪貼畫。</p><p></p><p>2025年2月中巴簽署合作協議，啟動巴基斯坦航天員選拔。齊尚．阿里作為項目工作人員參與，最終通過嚴格篩選脫穎而出，成為神舟任務乘組的一員。</p><p></p><p>作為空軍飛行員，他此前飛過的最高處是約15公里，而這一次，他的飛行高度刷新為400公里的浩瀚太空。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_QQ.PAK.ASTRONAUT-1800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k9fCWkC1Ya1795689080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他在乘組見面會上用中文說道，他的「首次」不僅代表他自己，更代表他的國家巴基斯坦，將2.5億巴基斯坦人的期望帶上軌道。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_QQ.PAK.ASTRONAUT-1800_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XfRTH9TlN71795689103.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從兒時日記簿的航天夢，到與中國航天員並肩遨遊星際，齊尚．阿里的太空之旅，實現了自己的夢想，亦見證著中巴友誼提升到新高度。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12809-%E6%81%90%E6%85%8C%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.117036+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:15.989911+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:15.508241+00:00","content_hash":"2d4d66f7f4a45e75123ee16ba3c185afc2cc11f4cee6ef112a0f9f9787c81e11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.117036+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}